# 301 redirects for retired/moved pages — THE RECORD ONLY. Render static sites do NOT
# read this file. The live rules are the service's Redirects/Rewrites (dashboard or
# POST /v1/services/{id}/routes), and Render skips a rule while a file exists at
# that path — so a redirected page's .html must be deleted from the repo.
# Change a rule there, then mirror it here.
# Format: <source>  <destination>  <status>

